DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42345::$$$message_0334_0000_0000$$$::"We're finally here![humming][lr]::
42346::$$$message_0334_0000_0001$$$::Man, we ran into a lotta weird trouble along the way, but I'm glad we all made it in one piece."::
42347::$$$message_0334_0000_0002$$$::"The onsen is all the way inside.[lr]::
42348::$$$message_0334_0000_0003$$$::[hfwww layer=1]L-let's charge in there and rest our weary shoulders, girls."::
42349::$$$message_0334_0000_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
42350::$$$message_0334_0000_0005$$$::"..."[lr]::
42351::$$$message_0334_0000_0006$$$::"W-what are you looking at me like that for!?[lr]::
42352::$$$message_0334_0000_0007$$$::[hfwww layer=1]I-if you've got something to say, let the secretary say it!"::
42353::$$$message_0334_0000_0008$$$::"Okay... Maki, how'd you know where the onsen was? You made a beeline for this spot."::
42354::$$$message_0334_0000_0009$$$::"Yeah. While the path was a little loopy due to the obstacles, it was a very short trek."::
42355::$$$message_0334_0000_0010$$$::"Makino-G. You've been here before, haven't you?"::
42356::$$$message_0334_0000_0011$$$::"Urgh... I mean, l come to pray at Ryudou Temple like anyone else who lives in Fuyuki..."[wvs]::
42357::$$$message_0334_0000_0012$$$::"Hehe. You disgrace yourself, Makidera.[lr]::
42358::$$$message_0334_0000_0013$$$::[hfpop layer=0]Allow me to finish that sentence for you."::
42359::$$$message_0334_0000_0014$$$::"Wha... A second Yukika?"::
42360::$$$message_0334_0000_0015$$$::"Heh. Not quite, Kane Himuro."::
42361::$$$message_0334_0000_0016$$$::"This evil Yukika is so different from yours that I can hardly bear to look at her. You and I are also alike, yet not."::
42362::$$$message_0334_0000_0017$$$::"Oh, Kane's here too.[lr]::
42363::$$$message_0334_0000_0018$$$::Wait...then..."::
42364::$$$message_0334_0000_0019$$$::"...Yeah. Sorry, Yukika and Kane."::
42365::$$$message_0334_0000_0020$$$::"Th-this happened because I'm selfish and impulsive..."::
42366::$$$message_0334_0000_0021$$$::"Yukika Manager Slap!"[wm canskip=0]::
42367::$$$message_0334_0001_0000$$$::"GAAAAH!"[wm canskip=0][se storage=se556.wav]::
42368::$$$message_0334_0002_0000$$$::"You really do get on my nerves, Maki. You've been whining nonstop since yesterday."::
42369::$$$message_0334_0002_0001$$$::"The next time you try to act cute, I'm dragging you along on a shopping trip to Nyakau."::
42370::$$$message_0334_0002_0002$$$::"That would be good medicine for her.[lr]::
42371::$$$message_0334_0002_0003$$$::I predict that she'll accidentally pay a 1,000-yen transaction with a 10,000-yen bill..."::
42372::$$$message_0334_0002_0004$$$::"And then run home crying after they refuse to believe her when she tries to take it back!"::
42373::$$$message_0334_0002_0005$$$::"Hehe. Oh ho ho ho ho!"::
42374::$$$message_0334_0002_0006$$$::"Ah ha ha ha ha!"::
42375::$$$message_0334_0002_0007$$$::"Ahh, why is this happening..."::
42376::$$$message_0334_0003_0000$$$::"Th-that's my line!"::
42377::$$$message_0334_0003_0001$$$::"What on Earth is happening!?[lr]::
42378::$$$message_0334_0003_0002$$$::[hfangry layer=1][se storage=se251.wav]Fess up, you idiot!"::
42379::$$$message_0334_0003_0003$$$::"Uh, well, y'know..."::
42380::$$$message_0334_0003_0004$$$::"Hehe. Still won't come clean? You really are hopeless.[lr]::
42381::$$$message_0334_0003_0005$$$::[hfwww layer=0]Very well. Go ahead and explain, Maki."::
42382::$$$message_0334_0003_0006$$$::"Uh, me?[lr]::
42383::$$$message_0334_0003_0007$$$::Y-yes, ma'am.[lr]::
42384::$$$message_0334_0003_0008$$$::So actually, I..."::
42385::$$$message_0334_0003_0009$$$::"Yukika Manager Slap 2!"[wm canskip=0]::
42386::$$$message_0334_0004_0000$$$::"Gwah!"::
42387::$$$message_0334_0005_0000$$$::"You're cursed! Your words, your actions, your expressions, all cursed![lr]::
42388::$$$message_0334_0005_0001$$$::[hfstamp layer=0][se storage=se325.wav]It's so cute, I can't take it!"::
42389::$$$message_0334_0005_0002$$$::"...Apologies. To explain on Maki's behalf, we are delusions created from your Maki's wish."::
42390::$$$message_0334_0005_0003$$$::"While soaking in this onsen yesterday, she wished for something as exciting as being reborn. Or rather..."::
42391::$$$message_0334_0005_0004$$$::"She wished to see a completely different Yukika, Kane Himuro."::
42392::$$$message_0334_0005_0005$$$::"..."::
42393::$$$message_0334_0005_0006$$$::"...I see."::
42394::$$$message_0334_0005_0007$$$::"And she just ran off without taking any responsibility for your creation."::
42395::$$$message_0334_0005_0008$$$::"W-what else was I supposed to do!?[lr]::
42396::$$$message_0334_0005_0009$$$::[hffacechg chara=蒔寺 face=哀 layer=1 time=200]I know people will get the wrong idea, but I'm no hero! I'm just a regular old black panther!"::
42397::$$$message_0334_0005_0010$$$::"Look how cute she is! How am I supposed to banish a doppelganger like that!?"::
42398::$$$message_0334_0005_0011$$$::"...I see. That explains why everyone has been reacting strangely to us. They've already met you."::
42399::$$$message_0334_0005_0012$$$::"To be accurate, they came to the onsen and were beaten at their own game. Those Einzbern maids were especially bizarre."::
42400::$$$message_0334_0005_0013$$$::"They suggested a peaceful resolution because we were fellow minor characters. That made them so easy to take advantage of."::
42401::$$$message_0334_0005_0014$$$::"I'm stunned at how foolish they were.[lr]::
42402::$$$message_0334_0005_0015$$$::[hffacechg chara=黒由紀香 face=喜 layer=0 time=200][hfpop layer=0]Hoho. Ohoho. Honyanyanya!"::
42403::$$$message_0334_0005_0016$$$::"Eeek... She's starting to crack! Our Yukika can't take this anymore..."::
42404::$$$message_0334_0005_0017$$$::"The only thing cracked is your skull![lr]::
42405::$$$message_0334_0005_0018$$$::[hfwww layer=1]What possessed you to imagine a Yukika like that!?"::
42406::$$$message_0334_0005_0019$$$::"I dunno, it just seemed fun in my head."::
42407::$$$message_0334_0005_0020$$$::"...Then there's no way around it.[lr]::
42408::$$$message_0334_0005_0021$$$::Dark Yukika. The fact that you've been waiting here means we must have the same objective."::
42409::$$$message_0334_0005_0022$$$::"Yes. You're going to the Tiger Dojo. What's the difference in our fighting strength?"::
42410::$$$message_0334_0005_0023$$$::"Hm. Our Maki is useless, and so is theirs. So it's down to you and me..."::
42411::$$$message_0334_0005_0024$$$::"According to my calculations, We would win ten out of ten matches."::
42412::$$$message_0334_0005_0025$$$::"After all, you have the genius professor, Kane Himuro.[wvl canskip=0 time=600] Kane. [hfpop layer=0][wvl canskip=0 time=400]Kanekane. Kanekanekane...!"::
42413::$$$message_0334_0005_0026$$$::"(Sh-she's a weird professor character!)"::
42414::$$$message_0334_0005_0027$$$::"That's just regular Kane."::
42415::$$$message_0334_0005_0028$$$::[delay speed=60]"[se storage=se605.wav][quake time=500 vmax=20 hmax=10]Eyebrows! [hffacechg chara=氷室 face=楽 layer=1 time=100][se storage=se606.wav][quake time=500 vmax=20 hmax=10]Adam's apple![hffacechg chara=氷室 face=怒 layer=1 time=100][se storage=se115.wav][quake time=500 vmax=20 hmax=10] To the front!"[delay speed=user]::
42416::$$$message_0334_0005_0029$$$::"Guaaaah!"::
42417::$$$message_0334_0006_0000$$$::"W-what the heck? What are you mad about!?[lr]::
42418::$$$message_0334_0006_0001$$$::[hfwww layer=1]The other you is insane!"::
42419::$$$message_0334_0006_0002$$$::"Stop her![lr]::
42420::$$$message_0334_0006_0003$$$::[hfwww layer=1]Make her stop talking like that!"::
42421::$$$message_0334_0006_0004$$$::"It does fit your character, though."::
42422::$$$message_0334_0006_0005$$$::"...[lr]::
42423::$$$message_0334_0006_0006$$$::You look like you're having fun."[lr]::

